"system-on-chip (SoC) devices for ultra-low power wireless applications. "
"nRF51 Series devices support a range of protocol stacks including Bluetooth "
"Smart (previously called Bluetooth low energy), ANT and proprietary 2.4GHz "
"protocols such as Gazell."
